    "goal": "win",
    "playerSide": "white",
    "explanation": {
      "es": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "El rey blanco está en la casilla de coronación y el negro, cortado por la torre en la columna d. El plan es «construir el puente»: la torre sube a la cuarta fila ("
        },
        {
          "kind": "move",
          "san": "Rd4",
          "number": "1.",
          "start": false,
          "written": "1.Td4"
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "), el rey sale de la casilla de coronación y, cuando lleguen los jaques, la torre los tapa desde la cuarta fila."
        }
      ],
      "en": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "The white king sits on the queening square and the black king is cut off by the rook on the d-file. The plan is “building a bridge”: the rook goes to the fourth rank ("
        },
        {
          "kind": "move",
          "san": "Rd4",
          "number": "1.",
          "start": false,
          "written": "1.Rd4"
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "), the king leaves the queening square and, when the checks come, the rook blocks them from the fourth rank."
        }
      ]
    }
  },
